1
00:00:00,914 --> 00:00:05,584
(Sheldon:)I see you bought Mama Italia
marinara spaghetti sauce.

2
00:00:05,836 --> 00:00:08,416
(Penny:)-Yep.
-That's the sauce my mother uses.

3
00:00:08,588 --> 00:00:09,918
(Sheldon:)She likes cooking Italian...

4
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:13,630
(Sheldon:)...because, according to her,
that's what the Romans made Jesus eat.

5
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:18,218
(Penny:)Interesting. I'll have to have you over
for spaghetti some night.

6
00:00:18,431 --> 00:00:19,761
(Sheldon:)I'm hungry now.

7
00:00:21,101 --> 00:00:24,641
(Penny:)Oh, um, okay. Why don't you give me
an hour and come over?

8
00:00:24,813 --> 00:00:29,113
(Sheldon:)Will you cut up hot dogs into little
chunks and mix them in with the sauce?

9
00:00:29,276 --> 00:00:31,946
(Penny:)-I don't have hot dogs.
-It's all right. I do.

10
00:00:32,112 --> 00:00:36,532
Oh. You're in for what my mother calls
a real Italian treat.

11
00:00:39,953 --> 00:00:43,793
(Leonard:)-Hey, where you been?
-I was talking with Penny.

12
00:00:44,082 --> 00:00:47,252
(Howard:)What's wrong with you? You can't
hang out with your roommate's ex.

13
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,500
(Howard:)That's totally uncool.

14
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:52,170
(Leonard:)No, it's fine. I don't care. I'm over it.

15
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,300
Yeah. That's why he's been whining...

16
00:00:54,467 --> 00:00:58,137
(Raj:)...about trying to invent that
memory-wiper gizmo from Men in Black.

17
00:00:58,889 --> 00:01:00,309
(Sheldon:)Is he making any progress?

